      "title": "Codex Resets Turned a $40 Plan Into $1,211 in 12 Days",
      "titleCore": "Codex resets turned 12 days of a $100 plan into $1,211 of usage",
      "description": "Two global and five banked Codex resets gave us 8 weekly windows in 12 days on Pro $100: $1,211 of API value vs a $351 ceiling without them. Charts and CSV.",
      "body": "<p>Twelve days of ChatGPT Pro $100 costs about $40. In those 12 days we pulled <strong>$1,211 of API-priced Codex</strong> out of it. The plan did not do that. The resets did. Without them, the most 12 days could have held is two weekly windows, about <strong>$351</strong>. With two global resets and five banked resets, we got eight.</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Return on the plan:</strong> about 30x the prorated cost.</li>\n<li><strong>Share of value that came from resets:</strong> about 71%.</li>\n<li><strong>Fastest window:</strong> 7.2 hours from 0% to 100%.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>The gauge, hour by hour</h2>\n\n<p>This is the Codex weekly gauge for every hour we used it. Each drop to zero is a reset. B marks a banked reset we redeemed; G marks a global reset OpenAI pushed to everyone. A normal week would show one slow climb. Ours shows eight.</p>\n\n<figure style=\"margin:30px 0 34px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 360\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"b1-t\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit\"><title id=\"b1-t\">Codex weekly gauge, hour by hour, Sep 27 to Oct 8 (B = banked reset, G = global reset)</title><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"302.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"302.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"306.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">0%</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"236.5\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"236.5\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"240.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">25%</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"171.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"171.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"175.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">50%</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"105.5\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"105.5\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"109.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">75%</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">100%</text><line x1=\"89.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"89.7\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"89.7\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 28</text><line x1=\"208.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"208.7\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"208.7\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 30</text><line x1=\"327.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"327.7\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"327.7\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 2</text><line x1=\"446.6\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"446.6\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"446.6\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 4</text><line x1=\"565.6\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"565.6\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"565.6\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 6</text><line x1=\"684.5\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"684.5\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"684.5\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 8</text><line x1=\"81.6\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"81.6\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#6FA8DC\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"81.6\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6FA8DC\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><line x1=\"127.2\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"127.2\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#6FA8DC\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"127.2\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6FA8DC\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><line x1=\"209.4\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"209.4\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#6FA8DC\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"209.4\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6FA8DC\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><line x1=\"349.5\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"349.5\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#6FA8DC\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"349.5\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6FA8DC\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><line x1=\"380.1\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"380.1\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#E8895C\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"380.1\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#E8895C\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">G</text><line x1=\"639.9\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"639.9\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#E8895C\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"639.9\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#E8895C\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">G</text><line x1=\"700.6\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"700.6\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#6FA8DC\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><text x=\"700.6\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6FA8DC\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><polyline points=\"62.5,294.1 65.0,270.6 67.4,236.5 69.9,181.5 72.4,113.4 74.9,87.2 77.3,61.0 79.8,288.9 82.3,252.2 84.8,218.2 87.3,210.3 89.7,194.6 92.2,194.6 94.7,181.5 97.2,168.4 99.7,165.8 104.6,165.8 112.0,139.6 114.5,110.7 117.0,79.3 119.5,68.8 122.0,53.1 124.4,40.0 126.9,291.5 129.4,283.7 131.9,278.4 134.3,267.9 136.8,260.1 139.3,241.7 141.8,231.3 146.7,223.4 149.2,205.1 151.7,202.4 154.2,199.8 156.7,199.8 159.1,197.2 161.6,197.2 164.1,194.6 166.6,192.0 169.0,163.1 171.5,142.2 174.0,142.2 179.0,139.6 181.4,129.1 183.9,121.2 191.3,102.9 193.8,89.8 196.3,74.1 198.8,63.6 201.3,58.3 203.7,50.5 206.2,40.0 208.7,288.9 211.2,283.7 223.6,283.7 226.0,283.7 228.5,278.4 231.0,273.2 236.0,267.9 238.4,265.3 245.9,247.0 248.3,236.5 250.8,223.4 253.3,220.8 290.5,173.6 295.4,160.5 307.8,155.3 310.3,142.2 312.8,131.7 315.3,113.4 317.7,97.6 320.2,87.2 322.7,79.3 325.2,71.4 327.7,63.6 330.1,61.0 332.6,55.7 335.1,53.1 337.6,50.5 340.0,47.9 342.5,47.9 345.0,42.6 347.5,302.0 350.0,296.8 352.4,294.1 354.9,288.9 357.4,288.9 359.9,283.7 362.3,275.8 364.8,275.8 367.3,273.2 369.8,270.6 372.3,267.9 374.7,267.9 377.2,265.3 379.7,299.4 382.2,299.4 384.7,296.8 387.1,294.1 389.6,291.5 392.1,288.9 394.6,286.3 397.0,286.3 399.5,283.7 402.0,281.0 404.5,278.4 407.0,275.8 409.4,267.9 411.9,262.7 414.4,257.5 416.9,249.6 419.3,233.9 421.8,220.8 424.3,207.7 426.8,197.2 429.3,186.7 431.7,173.6 434.2,160.5 436.7,155.3 439.2,147.4 441.7,139.6 444.1,136.9 464.0,129.1 466.4,116.0 468.9,108.1 471.4,100.3 473.9,95.0 476.3,89.8 478.8,84.5 481.3,76.7 483.8,68.8 486.3,66.2 488.7,58.3 491.2,53.1 493.7,53.1 496.2,53.1 533.3,50.5 535.8,50.5 607.7,50.5 610.2,45.2 637.4,302.0 639.9,294.1 642.4,275.8 644.9,262.7 647.3,244.4 649.8,215.5 652.3,197.2 654.8,181.5 657.3,171.0 659.7,165.8 662.2,147.4 664.7,136.9 667.2,126.5 669.7,118.6 672.1,97.6 674.6,61.0 677.1,47.9 679.6,42.6 682.0,40.0 699.4,288.9 701.9,262.7 704.3,249.6 706.8,247.0 709.3,241.7 711.8,231.3 714.3,223.4 716.7,218.2 719.2,218.2 721.7,218.2 729.1,212.9 731.6,194.6 734.1,173.6 736.6,155.3 739.0,139.6 741.5,136.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E8895C\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7F8BA0;margin-top:8px\">Codex weekly gauge, hour by hour, Sep 27 to Oct 8 (B = banked reset, G = global reset)</figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Note the drop on October 2. We redeemed a banked reset at 08:49, used 14% of it, and twelve hours later a global reset replaced it. That cost us about $150 of value, and it is why we wrote <a href=\"/research/codex-banked-reset-when-to-redeem\">a guide to when to redeem a banked reset</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>What the plan would have delivered without resets</h2>\n\n<p>A Codex weekly window starts with your first request and lasts 7 days. Our first Pro window opened on September 27 at 13:26 UTC, so with no resets the second would have opened on October 4 and the 12 days would have ended partway through it. At our measured $175 per full window, the ceiling is about $351, and that assumes we used every bit of both.</p>\n\n<figure style=\"margin:30px 0 34px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 360\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"b2-t\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit\"><title id=\"b2-t\">Cumulative API value: with resets vs the most a no-reset plan could hold vs what the plan cost</title><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"302.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"302.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"306.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$0</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"264.6\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"264.6\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"268.6\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$200</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"227.1\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"227.1\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"231.1\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$400</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"189.7\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"189.7\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"193.7\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$600</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"152.3\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"152.3\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"156.3\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$800</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"114.9\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"114.9\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"118.9\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$1,000</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"77.4\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"77.4\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"81.4\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$1,200</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$1,400</text><line x1=\"89.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"89.7\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"89.7\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 28</text><line x1=\"208.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"208.7\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"208.7\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 30</text><line x1=\"327.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"327.7\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"327.7\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 2</text><line x1=\"446.6\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"446.6\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"446.6\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 4</text><line x1=\"565.6\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"565.6\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"565.6\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 6</text><line x1=\"684.5\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"684.5\" y2=\"302\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"684.5\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 8</text><polyline points=\"62.5,300.4 65.0,297.3 67.4,291.3 69.9,283.4 72.4,273.5 74.9,271.1 77.3,267.9 79.8,263.4 82.3,258.9 84.8,254.6 87.3,253.7 89.7,252.0 92.2,251.9 94.7,250.2 97.2,248.7 99.7,248.6 104.6,248.5 112.0,245.1 114.5,241.5 117.0,239.2 119.5,238.0 122.0,236.2 124.4,235.1 126.9,233.7 129.4,232.6 131.9,231.8 134.3,230.4 136.8,229.4 139.3,226.7 141.8,225.3 146.7,224.4 149.2,222.7 151.7,222.4 154.2,222.4 156.7,222.4 159.1,222.3 161.6,222.3 164.1,222.3 166.6,221.7 169.0,218.2 171.5,215.4 174.0,215.3 179.0,215.2 181.4,214.0 183.9,212.9 191.3,210.8 193.8,209.4 196.3,207.1 198.8,205.8 201.3,205.2 203.7,204.4 206.2,202.9 208.7,201.6 211.2,201.2 223.6,201.1 226.0,201.1 228.5,200.1 231.0,199.8 236.0,199.7 238.4,199.5 245.9,198.8 248.3,197.7 250.8,196.5 253.3,196.4 290.5,196.3 295.4,195.9 307.8,195.5 310.3,194.9 312.8,194.3 315.3,193.5 317.7,192.8 320.2,192.3 322.7,190.7 325.2,189.5 327.7,188.1 330.1,187.6 332.6,187.1 335.1,186.6 337.6,186.0 340.0,185.7 342.5,185.5 345.0,184.9 347.5,184.1 350.0,183.4 352.4,182.8 354.9,182.1 357.4,181.7 359.9,181.0 362.3,179.9 364.8,179.7 367.3,179.3 369.8,179.0 372.3,178.6 374.7,178.5 377.2,178.2 379.7,178.0 382.2,177.7 384.7,177.5 387.1,177.2 389.6,176.9 392.1,176.3 394.6,176.1 397.0,176.0 399.5,175.7 402.0,175.4 404.5,175.1 407.0,174.4 409.4,173.6 411.9,173.2 414.4,172.8 416.9,172.3 419.3,171.3 421.8,170.2 424.3,169.0 426.8,167.4 429.3,165.9 431.7,163.7 434.2,162.4 436.7,161.8 439.2,160.4 441.7,159.4 444.1,158.9 464.0,158.1 466.4,156.5 468.9,155.5 471.4,154.2 473.9,153.6 476.3,152.7 478.8,151.7 481.3,150.3 483.8,149.3 486.3,148.4 488.7,147.3 491.2,146.7 493.7,146.3 496.2,146.3 533.3,146.2 535.8,146.2 607.7,146.1 610.2,145.4 637.4,145.4 639.9,143.9 642.4,141.2 644.9,138.8 647.3,135.4 649.8,130.8 652.3,127.8 654.8,125.4 657.3,123.4 659.7,122.5 662.2,119.4 664.7,117.4 667.2,115.8 669.7,114.2 672.1,110.7 674.6,104.7 677.1,102.8 679.6,101.9 682.0,101.5 699.4,99.4 701.9,95.4 704.3,93.5 706.8,93.0 709.3,92.1 711.8,90.5 714.3,89.3 716.7,88.4 719.2,88.2 721.7,88.2 729.1,87.5 731.6,84.4 734.1,81.1 736.6,78.0 739.0,75.4 741.5,75.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E8895C\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"63.6,269.2 479.9,269.2 479.9,236.3 741.5,236.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6FA8DC\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><polyline points=\"63.6,302.0 741.5,294.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7F8BA0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"737.5\" y=\"67.3\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E8895C\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">With resets: $1,211</text><text x=\"737.5\" y=\"228.3\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6FA8DC\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">No resets, ceiling: $351</text><text x=\"737.5\" y=\"286.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">Plan cost: $40</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7F8BA0;margin-top:8px\">Cumulative API value: with resets vs the most a no-reset plan could hold vs what the plan cost</figcaption></figure>\n\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Windows in 12 days</th><th>API value</th><th>Per $1 of plan</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Pro $100, no resets (ceiling)</td><td>2</td><td>$351</td><td>$9</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Pro $100, the resets we used</td><td>8</td><td>$1,211</td><td>$30</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Plus, no resets (for scale)</td><td>2</td><td>$134</td><td>$17</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2>How the math works</h2>\n\n<p>Codex writes a JSONL log of every session under <code>~/.codex/sessions/</code>. Each request records cumulative input, cached input and output tokens, plus the weekly gauge (<code>used_percent</code>) and its <code>resets_at</code> time. We priced every request's token delta at the API list price of the model it ran on and grouped requests by weekly window. Dollar figures are API-equivalent value, not money we paid.</p>\n\n<p>The prorated cost is $100 a month times 12/30, or $40. The no-reset ceiling is two full windows at our median of $175. The hourly series is in <a href=\"/assets/data/codex-pro-100-hourly.csv\" download>codex-pro-100-hourly.csv</a> (gauge percentage plus cumulative API value, cached and uncached) and the windows in <a href=\"/assets/data/codex-pro-100-windows.csv\" download>codex-pro-100-windows.csv</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Can you count on resets?</h2>\n\n<p>No. Public trackers have logged 59 resets since September 2025, and the pace sped up sharply this summer: 12 in July, 10 in August, 7 in September. But OpenAI has never promised them, and the gap between resets has been as long as 67 days. Price your plan on the no-reset line and treat everything above it as a bonus. Our <a href=\"/research/codex-reset-history\">Codex reset log</a> has the dated list.</p>\n\n<p>The multiplier matters too. A full Pro $100 window held 2.6x a Plus week, not 5x (<a href=\"/research/chatgpt-pro-100-real-codex-multiplier\">details here</a>). Resets are what made the plan a bargain, not the plan.</p>\n\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://codex-resets.com\">codex-resets.com: public Codex reset tracker</a></li><li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001507-paid-weekly-work-and-codex-rate-limit-resets\">OpenAI Help Center: paid weekly Work and Codex rate limit resets</a></li><li><a href=\"https://whenaireset.com/openai/2026-10-02\">When AI Reset: OpenAI reset of October 2, 2026</a></li><li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/pricing\">OpenAI: Codex plans and usage limits</a></li><li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing\">OpenAI API pricing</a></li></ul>",
      "faq": [
        {
          "question": "How much are Codex resets worth?",
          "answer": "In our 12 days on ChatGPT Pro $100, seven resets took us from a ceiling of about $351 of API-priced Codex to $1,211, roughly 71% of the total value."
        },
        {
          "question": "How many Codex weekly windows can you get in 12 days?",
          "answer": "Normally two at most, because a weekly window lasts 7 days. With two global resets and five banked resets we opened eight."
        },
        {
          "question": "Should I count on Codex resets when choosing a plan?",
          "answer": "No. OpenAI does not promise them and gaps between resets have reached 67 days. Size the plan on the no-reset value and treat resets as a bonus."
        }
